{"speciesId":352,"names":{"fr":"Kecleon","es":"Kecleon","en":"Kecleon","ja":"カクレオン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"KECLEON is capable of changing its body colors at will to blend in with its surroundings. There is one exception - this POKéMON can’t change the zigzag pattern on its belly."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"KECLEON alters its body coloration to blend in with its surroundings, allowing it to sneak up on its prey unnoticed. Then it lashes out with its long, stretchy tongue to instantly ensnare the unsuspecting target."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A POKéMON that has the ability to alter its body colors to match its surroundings. A KECLEON reverts to its original colors if it is startled."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It changes body color to blend in with its surroundings. It also changes color if it is happy or sad."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It changes body color to blend in with its surroundings. It also changes color if it is happy or sad."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It changes its shading to match its surroundings so it can sneak up on prey. Only its belly patterns stay fixed."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It changes its shading to match its surroundings so it can sneak up on prey. Only its belly patterns stay fixed."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il change de couleur à volonté, mais le motif en zigzag qui orne son ventre reste le même."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il change de couleur à volonté, mais le motif en zigzag qui orne son ventre reste le même."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il change de couleur à volonté, mais le motif en zigzag qui orne son ventre reste le même."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Puede mudar el color de su cuerpo a voluntad, pero el dibujo en zigzag de su panza nunca desaparece."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体の 色を 自由に 変える 能力を 持つ。お腹にある ギザギザ模様 だけは 変わらない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il se fond dans son environnement en changeant de couleur, mais le motif sur son ventre reste le même."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Acecha a sus presas adaptando sus colores a los del paisaje, pero los dibujos de su panza nunca cambian."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It changes its shading to match its surroundings so it can sneak up on prey. Only its belly patterns stay fixed."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体の 色を 変えて 景色に 溶けこみ 獲物に 忍び寄る。 お腹の 模様は 消せないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Kecleon est capable de modifier les couleurs de son corps pour se fondre dans son environnement. Il y a cependant une exception : ce Pokémon ne peut pas modifier la figure géométrique en zigzag sur son ventre."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Kecleon puede alterar la pigmentación de la piel para mezclarse con su entorno. Lo único que no es capaz de cambiar es el trazado en zigzag que tiene en la panza."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Kecleon is capable of changing its body colors at will to blend in with its surroundings. There is one exception—this Pokémon can’t change the zigzag pattern on its belly."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体の 色を 自在に 変える ことで 周りの 景色に 溶けこむ ことが できる。 お腹の ギザギザ模様 だけは 変えられない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kecleon change la couleur de son corps pour se fondre dans son environnement, ce qui lui permet de s’approcher de sa proie sans être repéré. Il envoie ensuite sa grande langue élastique pour piéger sa proie qui ne se doute de rien."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kecleon modifica la coloración de la piel para camuflarse en el medio en el que esté. Así, puede acercarse a hurtadillas a su enemigo sin que se dé cuenta y lanzarle la larga y elástica lengua que tiene para atraparlo por sorpresa."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kecleon alters its body coloration to blend in with its surroundings, allowing it to sneak up on its prey unnoticed. Then it lashes out with its long, stretchy tongue to instantly ensnare the unsuspecting target."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体を 景色と 同じ 色に 変えて 獲物に 気づかれない ように 忍びよる。 長く 伸びる ベロで 素早く 捕まえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il change de couleur pour se camoufler, mais si on cesse de lui prêter attention pendant trop longtemps, il se vexe et ne se montre plus..."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Cambia de color para fundirse con el paisaje, pero, si pasa desapercibido demasiado tiempo, se enfurruña y no vuelve a hacerse visible."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It changes its hue to blend into its surroundings. If no one takes notice of it for too long, it will pout and never reveal itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"身体の 色を 変えて 景色に 溶け込む。 長く かまわないでいると スネて 姿を 見せなくなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sa couleur change quand il se cache, mais varie aussi selon son humeur et son état de santé : plus il est en forme, plus sa couleur est vive."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Incluso cuando no se está mimetizando, el color de su cuerpo cambia según cómo se encuentre. Un color más intenso indica mayor vitalidad."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its color changes for concealment and also when its mood or health changes. The darker the color, the healthier it is."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"隠れるとき 以外にも 気分や 調子で 身体の色が 変わる。 色が 濃いときほど 元気だぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":352,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"scratch","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[5,"level-up",4],[6,"level-up",4],[7,"level-up",4],[8,"level-up",4],[9,"level-up",4],[10,"level-up",4],[11,"level-up",4],[12,"level-up",4],[13,"level-up",4],[14,"level-up",4],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",4],[16,"level-up",4],[16,"